{"seq":4,"slug":"game-graphics","title":"游戏图形与渲染","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 游戏图形与渲染 简介\n\n图形渲染是游戏视觉表现的核心，它将数学描述的三维世界转化为玩家屏幕上看到的每一个像素。从实时光影到粒子特效，从骨骼动画到后处理效果，渲染技术的水准直接决定了游戏的视觉品质和艺术表现力。\n\n本知识库适用于有编程基础、希望深入理解实时渲染技术的开发者。无论你是想理解现代图形 API 的工作原理，还是想掌握引擎中各种视觉效果的实现方法，这里的内容都将为你提供系统化的知识框架。\n\n第1章**渲染管线**从图形管线的全局视角出发，讲解顶点处理、光栅化、片元着色等阶段的工作原理，以及前向渲染与延迟渲染两大主流架构的设计思路和适用场景。\n\n第2章**光照与阴影**深入探讨游戏中最核心的视觉元素，涵盖经典光照模型、阴影生成技术、全局光照方案以及基于物理的渲染方法，让你理解如何用数学模拟光与物质的交互。\n\n第3章**后处理效果**讲解在渲染完成后对画面进行增强的技术，包括后处理管线设计、粒子与视觉特效、屏幕空间效果以及色调映射和 HDR 渲染，这些是提升画面质感的\"最后一公里\"。\n\n第4章**动画系统**聚焦于游戏角色和物体的运动表现，涵盖骨骼动画、动画混合、反向运动学以及程序化动画技术，让游戏中的角色动作流畅自然。\n\n推荐学习路径：建议从第1章渲染管线开始建立全局认知，然后学习第2章光照与阴影掌握最核心的渲染技术，再通过第3章后处理效果提升画面品质，最后学习第4章动画系统。如果你对特定主题更感兴趣，各章也可以独立阅读。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-pipeline","title":"渲染管线","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graphics-pipeline-overview","title":"图形渲染管线概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/graphics-pipeline-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vertex-processing","title":"顶点处理与变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/vertex-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rasterization-and-fragment","title":"光栅化与片段处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/rasterization-and-fragment"},{"seq":4,"slug":"deferred-vs-forward","title":"延迟渲染与前向渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/deferred-vs-forward"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"lighting-and-shadow","title":"光照与阴影","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lighting-models","title":"光照模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/lighting-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shadow-techniques","title":"阴影技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/shadow-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-illumination","title":"全局光照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/global-illumination"},{"seq":4,"slug":"pbr-rendering","title":"PBR 渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/pbr-rendering"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-processing","title":"后处理效果","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"post-processing-pipeline","title":"后处理管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/post-processing-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"particle-and-vfx","title":"粒子系统与视觉特效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/particle-and-vfx"},{"seq":3,"slug":"screen-space-effects","title":"屏幕空间效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/screen-space-effects"},{"seq":4,"slug":"tone-mapping-hdr","title":"色调映射与 HDR 渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/post-processing/tone-mapping-hdr"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"animation-system","title":"动画系统","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/animation-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"skeletal-animation","title":"骨骼动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/animation-system/skeletal-animation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"animation-blending","title":"动画混合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/animation-system/animation-blending"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inverse-kinematics","title":"反向动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/animation-system/inverse-kinematics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"procedural-animation","title":"程序化动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/animation-system/procedural-animation"}]}]}